name=Adjustable Recipe Requirements
id=AdjustableRecipeRequirements
poster=poster.png
description=Removes skill level requirements from crafting and building recipes, optionally teaches every recipe, and makes crafting time depend on how your skill compares to the original requirement.
description=
description=Everything is configurable per save in Sandbox Options > Adjustable Recipe Requirements.
description=
description=Safe to add to an existing save (Load > More > Mods); it adds no items or objects, and existing saves use the default settings.
description=Safe to remove mid-game: requirements and crafting time return to vanilla. To make sure "Know all recipes" is cleared, turn that setting off and load the save once before removing the mod.
versionMin=42.0.0
